description = "A libretro core based on Mednafen 1.32.1 focused on the Sega Titan Video (ST-V) arcade hardware. The ST-V is an arcade board based on the Sega Saturn, sharing the same SH-2 CPUs, VDP1/VDP2, and SCSP sound chips. This core runs almost all ST-V games with few or no noticeable glitches, and provides accurate emulation of the full ST-V arcade library. Games are loaded as ROM dumps (ZIP or raw binary). At least one region BIOS file must be placed in the system directory."
